WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:11,280
This is the line on the map. We have to pass through several cities. There are definitely the most crazy people in these cities.

2
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:15,020
We can’t completely avoid walking on wild mountain trails.

3
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:19,570
It's not that easy. Except for Qingshui, we are not good at surviving in the wild.

4
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:25,180
And now that the weather is getting colder, it will be cold. Uzi District, but the city is a dumpling machine.

5
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,470
I think it's better to avoid it

6
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:33,490
